0023136.identifiedItemDescription:
A box with 3 [Not for sale] Butterfly Wing of 4 different colors. Each wing allows the user to teleport to a certain place.
[Not for sale]Yellow Butterfly Wing;
"Prontera", "Geffen", "Payon", "Morroc", "Aldebaran", "Izlude", "Alberta".

[Not for sale]Green Butterfly Wing;
"Juno", "Lighthalzen", Einbroch", "Hugel".

[Not for sale]Red Butterfly Wing;
"Veins", "Rachel".

[Not for sale]Blue Butterfly Wing;
"Ayothaya", "Amatsu", "Louyang", "Kunlun", "Moscovia", "Dewata", "Brasilis".

When using the Butterfly Wing;
If no location is selected after 1 minute, the item will disappear. Any selection made after that duration will not trigger the effect.
